# Chezmoi-managed files

Before creating or editing anything under `$HOME` that looks like config/dotfiles (or anything in `~/Developer/dotfiles`):

1. Read and follow the **chezmoi** skill: `~/.agents/skills/chezmoi/SKILL.md`
2. Edit `chezmoi source-path` (or `chezmoi edit` / `chezmoi add`) — not managed targets in place
3. `chezmoi apply` after source changes (dry-run first when unsure)

Repo detail: `~/Developer/dotfiles/docs/adr/0001-chezmoi-source-is-canonical.md`
